  "prefLabel": "Pes 101.10 Disposal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.10 \"Disposal\" means discarding, open burning, or incineration of excess of unusable pesticide materials and discarding of pesticide containers, or the sale or transfer of ownership of pesticide containers for use other than to contain pesticides.\n\nSource. #150, eff l-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss and moved by #6239, eff 5-2-96 (from Pes 101.09)",
